# 🔍 20. Mini SOC Investigation

Imagine you discover:

```text
backup-check.service
```

First:

```bash
systemctl status backup-check.service
```

Then:

```bash
systemctl is-enabled backup-check.service
```

View its configuration:

```bash
systemctl cat backup-check.service
```

Suppose you discover:

```text
ExecStart=/opt/scripts/check.sh
```

Investigate:

```bash
ls -lah /opt/scripts/check.sh
```

Then:

```bash
file /opt/scripts/check.sh
```

And:

```bash
stat /opt/scripts/check.sh
```

Read the script:

```bash
cat /opt/scripts/check.sh
```

Check whether it creates network connections:

```bash
sudo ss -tpn
```

Then identify the process:

```bash
ps aux
```

