# 🚨 23. Possible Persistence Indicators

During an investigation, pay attention to:

```text
Unknown systemd service
        ↓
Unexpected enabled service
        ↓
Unknown executable
        ↓
Recently created startup file
        ↓
Unexpected cron job
        ↓
Script running as root
        ↓
Process making unexpected network connections
```

These are **investigation indicators**, not automatic proof of malicious activity.

